#
# Plane strain patch (nodes 1-12): u = (F - I) X + b, F = [1.04 0.02; -0.01 0.97], b = (0.01, -0.02).
# Axisymmetric patch (nodes 13-24, x the radius): u_r = 0.03 R, u_y = -0.02 Y + 0.01, i.e. the constant
# F = 1.03 I - 0.05 e_y x e_y. The control points of an affine field are its values at the control points.
# Checked: the free interior control points 6, 7, 18 and 19 at the affine values.
#
